   "output": "TodayWeather/ko.lproj/InfoPlist.strings",
   "output_sha256": "4b55b99b1a2f864f3c9f38c1e9f38e0fc69ef3e368ea5ff8d8e7b860a4b4caeb",
   "value": "TodayWeather는 기기의 광고 식별자를 사용해 맞춤 광고를 보여 주고 광고 성과를 측정합니다. 추적을 허용하지 않아도 광고는 표시되지만 맞춤 광고는 아닙니다."
  },
  {
   "locale": "en",
   "source": "client/resources/ios/tracking/en.lproj/InfoPlist.strings",
   "commit": "f7cce5338ebbbf8d33978fd72ca1b5c1fc72c124",
   "source_sha256": "26308edf8892ee2cf649e5006757bbe7208e8b5891284ec443d5a6ef82ce4a02",
   "output": "TodayWeather/en.lproj/InfoPlist.strings",
   "output_sha256": "26308edf8892ee2cf649e5006757bbe7208e8b5891284ec443d5a6ef82ce4a02",
   "value": "TodayWeather uses your device's advertising identifier to show you personalized ads and to measure how ads perform. If you do not allow tracking, you still see ads, but they are not personalized."
  },
  {
   "locale": "ja",
   "source": "client/resources/ios/tracking/ja.lproj/InfoPlist.strings",
   "commit": "f7cce5338ebbbf8d33978fd72ca1b5c1fc72c124",
   "source_sha256": "c5d50de1ebd30ea20efe9e679702c6cf0f59e4e46e5105f006af2ce69637006e",
   "output": "TodayWeather/ja.lproj/InfoPlist.strings",
   "output_sha256": "c5d50de1ebd30ea20efe9e679702c6cf0f59e4e46e5105f006af2ce69637006e",
   "value": "TodayWeatherは、デバイスの広告識別子を使用して、パーソナライズされた広告を表示し、広告の効果を測定します。トラッキングを許可しない場合も広告は表示されますが、パーソナライズされません。"
  },
  {
   "locale": "zh-Hans",
   "source": "client/resources/ios/tracking/zh-Hans.lproj/InfoPlist.strings",
   "commit": "f7cce5338ebbbf8d33978fd72ca1b5c1fc72c124",
   "source_sha256": "ecf4c081c22f4b71c302b26d3dd0d4c1833c8f182734928a57d36fa44ce23221",
   "output": "TodayWeather/zh-Hans.lproj/InfoPlist.strings",
   "output_sha256": "ecf4c081c22f4b71c302b26d3dd0d4c1833c8f182734928a57d36fa44ce23221",
   "value": "TodayWeather 使用设备的广告标识符向您展示个性化广告并衡量广告效果。如果您不允许跟踪，仍会看到广告，但不是个性化广告。"
  },
  {
   "locale": "zh-Hant",
   "source": "client/resources/ios/tracking/zh-Hant.lproj/InfoPlist.strings",
   "commit": "f7cce5338ebbbf8d33978fd72ca1b5c1fc72c124",
   "source_sha256": "2edec3f09b9a831c419cb8dddf82f88419333e65e018aef271b1ee9b7abe3def",
   "output": "TodayWeather/zh-Hant.lproj/InfoPlist.strings",
   "output_sha256": "2edec3f09b9a831c419cb8dddf82f88419333e65e018aef271b1ee9b7abe3def",
   "value": "TodayWeather 會使用裝置的廣告識別碼向您顯示個人化廣告並衡量廣告成效。如果您不允許追蹤，仍會看到廣告，但不是個人化廣告。"
  }
